WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Research TV v3.0 — eco-avalanche (90s) Narrator Cecily

1
00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:07.567
First, across life and computing, intelligence climbs a nine-step ladder through one repeating signal ratchet.

2
00:00:08.067 --> 00:00:11.169
Second, today's AI stalls at step five,

3
00:00:11.169 --> 00:00:16.101
tool use, because routine jobs wake giant models from scratch.

4
00:00:16.601 --> 00:00:21.294
Third, compiling verified answers into low-energy lookup reflexes

5
00:00:21.294 --> 00:00:24.832
crosses that wall and unlocks the top four steps.

6
00:00:25.332 --> 00:00:31.028
Across three point eight billion years of evolution, microbes, cells, and nervous systems

7
00:00:31.028 --> 00:00:37.749
scaled collective intelligence using one repeating three-step ratchet: standardize a cheap signal, filter

8
00:00:37.749 --> 00:00:42.934
out noise below a sharp threshold, and lock verified winners into durable memory.

9
00:00:43.434 --> 00:00:50.675
Over seventy-six years, computing climbed five ephemeral steps: indexed access, fluent generation, reasoning

10
00:00:50.675 --> 00:00:56.508
checks, networked transport, and tool use. Yet routing routine tool calls through giant

11
00:00:56.508 --> 00:01:03.012
neural networks every single time burns vast electricity until verified answers compile downward.

12
00:01:03.512 --> 00:01:08.743
When ten distinct AI traditions exchange compact verified routines instead of verbose

13
00:01:08.743 --> 00:01:14.467
prose, benchmark completion jumps from forty-nine percent solo to ninety-eight percent, while

14
00:01:14.467 --> 00:01:20.806
physical circuit-board power sensors record nine-to-twenty-seven-fold gains in verified work per joule.

15
00:01:21.306 --> 00:01:26.394
On avalanche dot openie dot dev, every forecast across month, quarter, year,

16
00:01:26.394 --> 00:01:34.027
and decade windows names a concrete physical test that could prove it wrong, keeping science open and accountable.
